  "typical_application": "Frequency division (tie Q-bar to D for divide-by-2), shift registers, toggle/debounce stages.",
  "gotchas": [
    "clock is RISING-edge; data is captured only on the LOW-to-HIGH transition",
    "SET and RESET are active-HIGH and asynchronous; tie unused ones LOW, not floating",
    "asserting SET and RESET together is a non-standard state; avoid it",
    "Q-bar sits adjacent to Q (pins 1/2 and 12/13) and the order flips between the two flip-flops"
